{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38726","headline":"题战岛僧居 · 杜荀鹤","name":"题战岛僧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"师爱无尘地，江心岛上居。\n接船求化惯，登陆赴斋疎。\n载士春栽树，抛生日餧鱼。\n入云萧帝寺，毕竟欲何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38726.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38726","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}